1
00:00:00,550 --> 00:00:02,562
Looks ready to ship, right?

2
00:00:02,562 --> 00:00:05,025
You change a setting, close the dialog,

3
00:00:05,025 --> 00:00:07,100
and jump straight back to work.

4
00:00:07,100 --> 00:00:08,500
Until one tiny bug

5
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:10,850
makes your next move a guessing game.

6
00:00:10,850 --> 00:00:13,500
Focus Trail follows your keyboard journey,

7
00:00:13,500 --> 00:00:14,950
spots where it breaks,

8
00:00:14,950 --> 00:00:16,375
and helps you catch the problem

9
00:00:16,375 --> 00:00:18,175
before your users do.
